WEBVTT

NOTE
Sample captions for the bundled guide. They describe the trailer's beats
rather than quoting dialogue, so the offline demo never misrepresents a
licensed subtitle track.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A courier crosses the city before dawn.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Every district she passes forgets her name.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.500
The package in her bag should not exist.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
She has delivered it before, and will again.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Some streets only appear when you stop looking for them.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.500
A city that forgets you still remembers what you carry.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Neon Seoul — a Best guide sample.
